<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AMP further lowers Highlands stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AMP further lowers Highlands stake.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Mutual Society (AMP) has lowered its stake in Papua New Guinean gold producer Highlands Gold NL to 5.88 percent from 7.49 percent previously.</p>
<p>Last week, AMP said it had cut its Highlands stake to 7.49 percent from 8.52 percent previously. AMP said on Tuesday in a substantial shareholder notice to the Australian Stock Exchange that it now held 33.17 million Highlands shares.</p>
<p>Highlands shares closed one cent lower at 56 cents.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne Bureau 61-3 92861421</p>
